{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_05",
  "title": "危险交易",
  "storyCode": "MB-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb83aeeaacbdadec9457161b811f6a4f3da19fb1abf624c7f48e01f7c65828b4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默小姐你没事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，其实或许我要感谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那么，我们继续？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们刚才说到哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到安东尼对罗宾抛出橄榄枝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正在和梅尔小姐讨论安东尼的手段高超呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我觉得你可能是单纯的想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许，他当时没有想那么多，只是单纯地想要对罗宾付出善意呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我确实无法否认这种可能性啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过如果是单纯善良的人，是没有办法在这片大地上活下去的，赫默小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......算了，我不该和你讨论这个，梅尔说到哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及卡夫卡和安东尼讨论过后，安东尼终于决定越狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说到罗宾在医务室里醒来，被安东尼邀请加入越狱的队伍的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不说，赫默小姐，我确实有些好奇你究竟是从哪里获得安东尼这条线索的情报的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我的老师那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？难道帕尔维斯主任也插手了这件事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，我已经很久没有和他直接联络过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且他恐怕也不知道这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自从离开莱茵生命后，我把过去很多从没在意过的情报重新梳理了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在那之中，我抓到了西蒙家族这条尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个家族覆灭的时间很短，而且一些数据伪装得很好，所以在很多人看来，这些数据就仿佛没有变化过一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是伪装总是会有痕迹的。一些报表，一些统计数据，只要详细对比一下，就能发现其中的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本只是抱着试试的心态过了一遍那些数据，却没想到让我发现了这样的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是偶然发现......不，其实是必然吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你为什么会突然去梳理一遍那些数据呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我开始不信任莱茵生命，也不信任我的老师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“炎魔”事件吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不只是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“炎魔”导致了塞雷娅的离开，在那之后发生的一些事情想必缪尔赛思主任你比我更了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我只是随口问问，就这么告诉我这些事真的好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不就是你想听到的东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不擅长掩饰什么，缪尔赛思主任，所以我思考过后，决定对你坦诚相待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我并不喜欢我的老师，不过他有一句话我一直记得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“对阴谋家来说，最让他们恐惧的是坦诚。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来我被当作坏人了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，在罗德岛生活的时间教会了我一件事，那就是，不是所有反对你的就应该被当作坏人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，你不是坏人......塞雷娅也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能说，我和你，和塞雷娅都无法互相理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊哈，或许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "缪尔赛思主任，你还要继续听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，我正听到精彩的部分呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，不过故事应该差不多到这里就接近尾声了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是说，在那时，安东尼逃狱的队伍就已经差不多结成了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安东尼本人，入殓师杜玛，卡夫卡，临时工米娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上罗宾，就可以大家一起齐心协力越狱了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，没有这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗宾并没有加入安东尼的队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然确实在这之后，卡夫卡就开始和杜玛还有安东尼一起摸索越狱的方法，而且罗宾也加入了其中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是事情并没有这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还记得你之前提到的海德兄弟找来的帮手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "缪尔赛思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得，他怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "char_108_silent",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他找到了罗宾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
